        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>*This game does not include voice acting.<br>We noticed there are feedbacks on the English localization quality. We are working on a full proofreading of all English texts. Thank you for your support!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>This game is filled with a great number of puzzles, each varying in difficulty.</strong><br><strong>If you get stuck on a stage or you aren't sure how to proceed, check Steam Forum for hints. You'll surely find a lead towards the truth.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507560/extras/fc4adf74488ec8d155546dfb68059fd8.poster.avif?t=1759993566\" width=600 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507560/extras/fc4adf74488ec8d155546dfb68059fd8.webm?t=1759993566\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507560/extras/fc4adf74488ec8d155546dfb68059fd8.mp4?t=1759993566\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Perhaps there's a past that... we don't want to remember. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>But, is that really something we can just forget?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While this game features an engaging narrative and various puzzle-solving elements, it is ultimately a story that delves deep into the emotional taboos hidden within the human heart. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The theme of &quot;facing yourself&quot; comes up often, but how can someone actually accomplish that? Who is it that put the chains on your heart? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or perhaps we've never truly seen our &quot;real&quot; selves. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We hope that <strong>Type-NOISE: Shonen Shoujo</strong> is able to take our players on a journey to heal their own hearts, giving them the courage to take a step forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>✅About Streaming</strong><br><br><br><br><br><strong>You’re welcome to stream the entire game! We also welcome your impressions on social media!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please be mindful of spoilers! Share your posts with <strong><u>#Type-NOISE: Shonen Shojo</u></strong>!<br>For detailed streaming guidelines, please check the official website.<br>We’re also distributing streaming assets on the official site—feel free to use them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507560/extras/1b38a62688717512815ee28d5b80205e.webp?t=1759993566\" width=600 height=54 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>✅Over 40 diverse puzzles</strong><br><strong>Not a single dull moment while playing!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507560/extras/95983bb1b0842653a2194f7ee95dd31c.poster.avif?t=1759993566\" width=600 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507560/extras/95983bb1b0842653a2194f7ee95dd31c.webm?t=1759993566\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507560/extras/95983bb1b0842653a2194f7ee95dd31c.mp4?t=1759993566\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Type-NOISE: Shonen Shojo features a variety of over 40 different puzzles to solve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > From simple cause-and-effect reasoning to logical puzzles, Ace Attorney-style courtroom battles, and deductions much like mathematical theorems, even scenes where you gather clues with a single click are filled with clever gimmicks.<br>We guarantee a densely packed game experience that constantly challenges your thinking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>✅Six different stories that tackle emotional scars</strong><br><strong>A thrilling storyline that unfolds like a suspense drama.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507560/extras/6281e1a7e2ac8a242ddab3761527241b.poster.avif?t=1759993566\" width=600 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507560/extras/6281e1a7e2ac8a242ddab3761527241b.webm?t=1759993566\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507560/extras/6281e1a7e2ac8a242ddab3761527241b.mp4?t=1759993566\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>The setting is a city that closely resembles Tokyo, but clearly isn't.<br>Six teenagers brought together by a shared crisis strive to escape the city while gradually recovering their sealed-off memories.<br>Doubts, jealousy, foolishness, pride, malice, and greed.<br>Can they face their own pasts? And what is the true form of the city...?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>✅Escape from the distorted &quot;labyrinth of the heart&quot;</strong><br><strong>A fantastic visual novel experience that blends together beautiful art and an immersive story.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507560/extras/cfb85aebf711a12d3c01cfaeaecb1a97.poster.avif?t=1759993566\" width=600 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507560/extras/cfb85aebf711a12d3c01cfaeaecb1a97.webm?t=1759993566\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507560/extras/cfb85aebf711a12d3c01cfaeaecb1a97.mp4?t=1759993566\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The labyrinth formed from mental traumas is filled with surreal visuals, such as inverted hanging puppets, scattered paints, and lights and shadows that have been warped and distorted.<br>While you search for a way out, you will be immersed in a combination of story and art that goes far beyond just simple puzzle-solving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>✅Six expressive boys and girls, and one... ghost cat?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507560/extras/4d670d35c07a0beb7c9c67c969f83dfe.webp?t=1759993566\" width=600 height=54 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507560/extras/1eedbf7c96d3cda38b45b197b1973c7d.avif?t=1759993566\" width=600 height=437 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Zena</strong>: the story's protagonist. An icy girl that loves hero shows. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;I should be able to do it too, just like a hero...!&quot; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Itsuki</strong>: a boy tormented by jealousy </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Gah, so annoying! You're really pissing me off. Go make me a Hamburg steak or something.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Honoka</strong>: a stubborn and skeptical girl </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;In the end, it's someone else's problem. Doubting, being doubted... that's what it means to be human.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kaito</strong>: a boy filled with self-doubt</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Because of this scarred face, I was ostracized and called 'filthy.'&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hiyori</strong>: a streamer girl and habitual liar</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;I'll keep on going hyper-powerfully!! Start the video!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Soto</strong>: a meddlesome, yet honest boy </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;If you're going to do it, I'll be there to back you up.&quot; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Specter</strong>: the Whimsical Watcher of the City </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Noises! Leave 'em to me~!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>✅How to Join the Community</strong><br>Be sure to join our Discord server! Just click &quot;Discord&quot; on the right side of the Steam page!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507560/extras/a61d7505ae053e27a18fef6af7884aa3.avif?t=1759993566\" width=307 height=369 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can exchange hints about the game, share your impressions while playing, and report any bugs you come across. Why not share your own &quot;Noise&quot; as well?<br>Let's escape from <strong>Noise Scramble City</strong> together!</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>*This game does not include voice acting.<br>We noticed there are feedbacks on the English localization quality. We are working on a full proofreading of all English texts. Thank you for your support!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>This game is filled with a great number of puzzles, each varying in difficulty.</strong><br><strong>If you get stuck on a stage or you aren't sure how to proceed, check Steam Forum for hints. You'll surely find a lead towards the truth.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507560/extras/fc4adf74488ec8d155546dfb68059fd8.poster.avif?t=1759993566\" width=600 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507560/extras/fc4adf74488ec8d155546dfb68059fd8.webm?t=1759993566\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507560/extras/fc4adf74488ec8d155546dfb68059fd8.mp4?t=1759993566\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Perhaps there's a past that... we don't want to remember. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>But, is that really something we can just forget?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While this game features an engaging narrative and various puzzle-solving elements, it is ultimately a story that delves deep into the emotional taboos hidden within the human heart. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The theme of &quot;facing yourself&quot; comes up often, but how can someone actually accomplish that? Who is it that put the chains on your heart? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or perhaps we've never truly seen our &quot;real&quot; selves. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We hope that <strong>Type-NOISE: Shonen Shoujo</strong> is able to take our players on a journey to heal their own hearts, giving them the courage to take a step forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>✅About Streaming</strong><br><br><br><br><br><strong>You’re welcome to stream the entire game! We also welcome your impressions on social media!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please be mindful of spoilers! Share your posts with <strong><u>#Type-NOISE: Shonen Shojo</u></strong>!<br>For detailed streaming guidelines, please check the official website.<br>We’re also distributing streaming assets on the official site—feel free to use them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507560/extras/1b38a62688717512815ee28d5b80205e.webp?t=1759993566\" width=600 height=54 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>✅Over 40 diverse puzzles</strong><br><strong>Not a single dull moment while playing!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507560/extras/95983bb1b0842653a2194f7ee95dd31c.poster.avif?t=1759993566\" width=600 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507560/extras/95983bb1b0842653a2194f7ee95dd31c.webm?t=1759993566\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507560/extras/95983bb1b0842653a2194f7ee95dd31c.mp4?t=1759993566\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Type-NOISE: Shonen Shojo features a variety of over 40 different puzzles to solve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > From simple cause-and-effect reasoning to logical puzzles, Ace Attorney-style courtroom battles, and deductions much like mathematical theorems, even scenes where you gather clues with a single click are filled with clever gimmicks.<br>We guarantee a densely packed game experience that constantly challenges your thinking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>✅Six different stories that tackle emotional scars</strong><br><strong>A thrilling storyline that unfolds like a suspense drama.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507560/extras/6281e1a7e2ac8a242ddab3761527241b.poster.avif?t=1759993566\" width=600 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507560/extras/6281e1a7e2ac8a242ddab3761527241b.webm?t=1759993566\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507560/extras/6281e1a7e2ac8a242ddab3761527241b.mp4?t=1759993566\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>The setting is a city that closely resembles Tokyo, but clearly isn't.<br>Six teenagers brought together by a shared crisis strive to escape the city while gradually recovering their sealed-off memories.<br>Doubts, jealousy, foolishness, pride, malice, and greed.<br>Can they face their own pasts? And what is the true form of the city...?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>✅Escape from the distorted &quot;labyrinth of the heart&quot;</strong><br><strong>A fantastic visual novel experience that blends together beautiful art and an immersive story.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507560/extras/cfb85aebf711a12d3c01cfaeaecb1a97.poster.avif?t=1759993566\" width=600 height=254 ><source src=